        "prompt": "You are a technical summarizer. Generate a comprehensive weekly development summary based on the following data:\n\nCOMMITS:\n{{ $node[\"2\"].json.result }}\n\nCLOSED ISSUES:\n{{ $node[\"3\"].json.result }}\n\nMERGED PRS:\n{{ $node[\"4\"].json.result }}\n\nProvide a narrative summary in {{ $language }} that highlights key achievements, trends, and notable changes. Structure the summary with clear sections and use professional but engaging language.",
